    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33017" root="فج" body-key="f">
    
      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">افجّ</span></b> : see 1, former half. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also, (L,) or
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَفَجَّتْ</span>, (S, O, L, K,) <i>He,</i> or <i>she,</i> (i. e. an ostrich)
<i>muted.</i> ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  And, the former, <i>He travelled a road
such as is termed</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَجّ</span>; (O, L, K;) said of a man;
(O;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">افتجّ</span></b> . (L.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <i>He,</i> (a man,
S, O,) or <i>it,</i> (a thing, Msb,) <i>hastened, went quickly,</i>
or <i>was quick;</i> (S, O, Msb, K;) mentioned by IAar.
(S.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  See also 1, near the end.

